error[E0502]: cannot borrow `arena` as mutable because it is also borrowed as immutable
  --> tests/ui/use_after_rewind.rs:10:5
   |
 9 |     let r = arena.alloc(1u32);
   |             ----- immutable borrow occurs here
10 |     arena.rewind();
